[gd_scene load_steps=30 format=3]

; Rear three-point linkage + PTO stub for the Kenney tractor body. Measured against that
; body: near the centreline it ends at z ~ +0.99, ground is y ~ 0 at ride height, and the
; rear tyre inner faces are at |x| = 0.253 -- so the draft arms run inboard at |x| = 0.19
; until they are clear of the tyres (z > 1.27), then splay to the ball ends at |x| = 0.37.
;
; Every pivot node is authored with its geometry along local +Z and posed by
; ThreePointHitch as rotation.x = -planar_angle; the poses below are the RAISED state, so
; the scene opens looking like the tractor's spawn pose. NO CollisionShape anywhere.

